  "limitations": [
    "Regular reference surfaces are qualified for the retained fixtures. A singular derivative can reject the operation before editing the document; poles and every closed-surface seam convention are not qualified.",
    "Plane supports corner and three-point input. Other Rectangle modes and alternative GroupFrameOrigin settings are not implemented.",
    "Nonlinear native refits are approximate and can choose different knots/control nets. Four observed refit witnesses exceed the document epsilon at corresponding parameters; their larger explicit comparison bounds do not apply to point maps, preserved structures, grips, or metadata.",
